<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Viva la XV Brigada</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, new words</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">El Ejército del Ebro; ¡Ay, Manuela!; Rumba la Rumba</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, new words</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">El Río del Nervión (Nationalist version)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, new words</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">¡Ay, Carmela!, film (Carlos Saura)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1990</span><span class="sg-chain-h">title, and used in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Darko Rundek, U širokom svijetu</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2000</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new anti-fascist words</span></li></ul></section>
